            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/465060/extras/28f3cb674d9c27a121b8745a51826e53.avif?t=1713251074\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>A sequel that isn’t afraid to be different. Triangle Service’s EXZEAL is the followup to TRIZEAL Remix, but it’s much more than a simple rehash. Choose between multiple ships and specialize in each one’s weapon system. Will you focus on good old shooting, virtuously patient shot charging, or dangerous but powerful close-range attacks? In EXZEAL, it’s your choice.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4+ different weapon systems to choose from<br></li><li>Two-player local cooperative play<br></li><li>Replay support<br></li><li>Memorable soundtrack spanning multiple genres of music<br></li><li>Includes Steam Achievements, Leaderboards, and Cloud saves</li></ul>",
