                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Good preservation, but not a very good game. I like the other Triangle Service shmups, but this feels like a watered down retread of Trizeal which is way better. The bosses and music are fun, but some of the levels are slow and gimmicky. Level 3 in particular kills my enjoyment every time because you have to shoot through physics-based crates and it's very drawn out and cumbersome in practice.\n\nI'd only recommend this slightly-below average shoot-em-up if you want to support a respectable doujin team. I would however recommend XIIZeal, DeltaZeal, and Trizeal before this.",
